  "content_html": "<p style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;<span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><span style=\"text-align: center;\">&nbsp;</span><img border=\"0\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEhjiYJPAm84oR3355jnNlHmNwiPqVmvALUOfbGD4zU52Ki1L4KhkX-u7PehC4FMyNeLEWRp7902hChkHdOJkXbvYISL4fC3sW1R-KGIJ0pmghlHxc-GjbvJnWnrLtbgtAorCJfU9-uyj4NXxingMIUxQOuOLMcckSrr5WGrDqnQRyK-xKVDlJtvJuN8_pQ/w200-h183/%E2%80%8F%E2%80%8F%D7%9C%D7%9B%D7%99%D7%93%D7%94.PNG\" style=\"text-align: center;\" /></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"><h2><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\">🕯️ מעט מן האור</span></h2><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בִּפְרוֹס הַיּוֹבֵל -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִישׁ אֶל מִשְׁפַּחְתּוֹ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תָּשֻׁבוּ.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">וּבִמְשֹׁךְ הַיּוֹבֵל -<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">אִישׁ בַּאֲחֻזָּתוֹ,<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">תָּדוּרוּ.</span></p><p data-end=\"789\" data-start=\"705\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">בִּשְׁנַת הַיּוֹבֵל הַזֹּאת<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">יִנָּתֵן לָכֶם הָאוֹת.</span></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">📘 עצה שבועית</span></h2><p></p><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">אַל תִּבָּהֵל מִמַּצָּב זְמַנִּי.</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">בְּיוֹבֵל - הַכֹּל חוֹזֵר.</div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\">כָּךְ גַּם בַּחַיִּים: מָה שֶׁשַּׁיָּךְ לְךָ בֶּאֱמֶת - עוֹד יָשׁוּב אֵלֶיךָ.</div></span><p></p><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">🌀 הצד השני של המטבע</span></h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc; font-family: arial;\"></span></p><p style=\"clear: both; text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">כְּשֵׁם שֶׁאַתָּה רוֹצֶה&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">שֶׁיָּשִׁיבוּ לְךָ<br /></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">-&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">הָשֵׁב מָה שֶׁאֵינֶנּוּ שֶׁלְּךָ</span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\">.</span></p><div><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><h2 style=\"font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"background-color: #fff2cc;\">💎 פנינה</span></h2></span><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><p>\"כִּי יוֹבֵל הִוא\" = 90 = גְּאוּלִים</p><h2 style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 23px; line-height: 1.3em; margin: 0px 0px 20px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px rgb(255, 242, 204); border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">📘 מילון ארמי־עברי</span></h2><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: arial; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"><i style=\"background: 0px 0px; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\">חמש מילים מארמית שבתורה - עם פענוח והארה לשונית.</i></span><b style=\"font-family: arial;\">&nbsp;</b></p><p style=\"background: 0px 0px white; border: 0px; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; font-size: 15px; margin: 0px 0px 25px; outline: none; padding: 0px; vertical-align: baseline;\"></p><p><b><span face=\"Arial, sans-serif\"></span></b></p><ol style=\"box-sizing: border-box; counter-reset: templateify 0; margin: 10px 0px; paddin